Package: omixerRpm
Type: Package
Title: Metabolic module profiling of microbiome samples
Version: 0.6.0
Date: 2026-11-03
Author: Youssef Darzi
Maintainer: Youssef Darzi<youssef.darzi@omixer.io>
Description: An R interface to the omixer-rpm for metabolic module profiling of microbiome samples,
    from KEGG KO profiles (with or without taxa) or HUMAnN KO tables.
    The bundled omixer-rpm.jar is licensed under an Academic Non-commercial Software License Agreement,
    <https://github.com/raeslab/omixer-rpm/blob/master/LICENSE>.
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 21)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
